{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":1772523,"username":"Suvaydan","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/b9bd4f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-04-12T13:33:22.332Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHello,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Shopify store has approximately 6,000 product variants. We decided to use metafields to add individual descriptions for each variant. However, when we tried to bulk import this metafield data, we discovered that Shopify’s native CSV import does not support variant metafields.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo accomplish this, we are required to either purchase a third-party application or build a custom solution using the Admin API. Third-party applications mean additional costs and potential security concerns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is quite surprising to us that Shopify grants this capability to third-party apps while not offering it through its own native import tool. This inconsistency is something we genuinely struggle to understand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe would like to formally request that variant metafields be supported in the standard CSV import/export functionality. This is a critical need, especially for stores with large product catalogs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKemal B.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-12T13:33:22.332Z","reply_count":2,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":144,"reads":35,"readers_count":34,"score":782.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":3}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1619828,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/1","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"calendar_details":[],"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":2},{"id":"+1","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":3,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null,"can_vote":false},{"id":1772533,"username":"PaulNewton","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/paulnewton/{size}/81148_2.png","created_at":"2026-04-12T15:46:28.600Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThese are the peer to peer forums.\u003cbr\u003e\nTHEN make an actual feature requests by using the help centerto file it with an actual shopify support advisor \u003ca href=\"https://help.shopify.com/\"\u003ehttps://help.shopify.com/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Suvaydan\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"607347\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/b9bd4f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Suvaydan:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is quite surprising to us that Shopify grants this capability to third-party apps while not offering it through its own native import tool. This inconsistency is something we genuinely struggle to understand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt’s not surprising shopify can’t DO EVERYTHING FOR EVERYONE ALL THE TIME.\u003cbr\u003e\nSo they make the systems that let merchants built WHATEVER THEY WANT.\u003cbr\u003e\nMaybe some day they’ll get to it but changes the CSV format are dangerous so they only do it rarely.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShopify has gone out of it’s way to have apis to cover as many use cases as possible because they themselves don’t have infinite resources to bloat the default admin with every feature imaginable.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThis is a critical need\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThen build it already, the underlying api’s are there specifically for this stuff.\u003cbr\u003e\nIf you have custom needs then build it, it’s entitlement to frame it the way you did.\u003cbr\u003e\nWhy would you not invest in your business instead of hoping some other company would maybe possibly kinda sorta put it in front of you one day.\u003cbr\u003e\nyeeeesh.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":2,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-12T15:46:28.600Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":31,"readers_count":30,"score":26.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://help.shopify.com/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"clicks":2}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":6353,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/2","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1772545,"username":"Michross","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/michross/{size}/388510_2.png","created_at":"2026-04-12T16:44:17.887Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThanks paul for your honest response, too much dependance on a platform, while they offer solution, he still finds it quite expensive and bugging, expecting them to handle everything on their own.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":3,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-12T16:44:17.887Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":2,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":25,"readers_count":24,"score":15.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":6353,"username":"PaulNewton","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/paulnewton/{size}/81148_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1591298,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/3","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1772628,"username":"lumine","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/lumine/{size}/397511_2.png","created_at":"2026-04-13T04:22:30.992Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003e6000 variants is a lot to manage one by one. While waiting for Shopify to maybe add this natively, Matrixify handles variant metafields through CSV really well. You set up columns like Variant.Metafield:custom.description and it maps them on import. Works with the existing Shopify CSV format so the learning curve is pretty short.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor that volume it’s probably the fastest path without touching the API. The free plan covers small batches if you want to test it before committing.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAre all 6000 variants getting unique descriptions or are you grouping them by product type? That might open up a bulk approach even with native tools.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":4,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T04:22:30.992Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":23,"readers_count":22,"score":74.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":1}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1615571,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/4","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[{"id":"heart","type":"emoji","count":1}],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":1,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1772990,"username":"natashadisante","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/natashadisante/{size}/172703_2.png","created_at":"2026-04-13T18:39:01.227Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Kemal\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShopify’s native CSV import not supporting variant metafields is a known gap. The Mixtable Bulk Editor handles exactly this. You can import variant metafield data via CSV across a catalog of 6,000+ variants without needing custom API work. We’ve put together a full guide on how it works here: \u003ca href=\"https://www.mixtable.com/help-center/user-guide/shopify/import-csv-update-shopify-data/\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003eImport CSV to Update or Add Shopify Data\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":5,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T18:39:01.227Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":3,"reads":19,"readers_count":18,"score":18.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://www.mixtable.com/help-center/user-guide/shopify/import-csv-update-shopify-data/","internal":false,"reflection":false,"title":"Import CSV to Update or Add Shopify Data","clicks":6}],"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":449256,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/5","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1773076,"username":"Moss_Mercury","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/eada6e/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-04-13T21:20:50.027Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eThis is still a gap in Shopify. Native CSV import doesn’t properly support variant metafields, so anything beyond small edits gets clunky fast.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWorkaround is using variant IDs with API or bulk tools, but that adds complexity for what should be simple.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re doing this often, Altera integrates directly with Google Sheets, so you can pull your data into a live sheet, make variant metafield updates there, and even use Claude to help structure, clean or update the data. Then you can preview the exact changes before importing, which helps catch mismatches or unintended edits before anything goes live.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStill something Shopify should support natively, but this gives you a much safer workflow in the meantime.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":6,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-04-13T21:20:50.027Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":16,"reads":19,"readers_count":18,"score":83.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":"shopifypartner","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":"Shopify Partner","title_is_group":true,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1566831,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/6","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1807002,"username":"misterBoy","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/7bcc69/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-06-02T17:33:44.868Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI feel your pain. I found it out myself today… I saw product metafields, and so many column when I exported a product, it never crossed my mind variant metafield wouldn’t import… I have 150variants to creates and each of them have multiple metafield to fill. I really didn’t want to do it by hand, I created a special tool to extract all the info and place in the proper column…\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePartners will say you can’t expect shopify to support all specific features we want. I mean, variant description is pretty basic feature if you ask me. How else can you have independant variant description than store it inside a metafield.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eanyway. I’ll use the bulk edit and copy and paste I guess. It will work for this time, but when I need to update them, that going to be hard on my brain.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eyes third party app exists, but they all requires access to customer data, and that is a complete no for us. If they wouldn’t require access to that, I would consider it\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":7,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-06-02T17:33:44.868Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":11,"readers_count":10,"score":2.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":"shopifystaff","flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1555269,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/7","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1808240,"username":"Ywilliams","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/y/ccd318/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-06-05T04:53:51.156Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eYeah, this is one of those Shopify CSV limits that is easy to miss until you hit it.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you’re avoiding third-party apps because of customer data access, I wouldn’t try to force the native CSV importer to do variant metafields. It will probably keep wasting time because product metafields and variant metafields behave differently.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor 150 variants, I’d do this in a controlled way:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eExport the products so you have the variant SKUs/IDs in one place.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMake a separate sheet that maps each variant SKU to the metafield values you want.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTest the update on 2 variants first, not all 150.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKeep that mapping sheet as your source of truth for future updates.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe hard part later will not be writing the descriptions. It will be matching the right metafield value back to the right variant without accidentally updating the wrong one.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf you do end up using the bulk editor manually this time, I’d still keep that SKU → metafield mapping sheet. It will save you when you need to update them again.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":9,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-06-05T04:53:51.156Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":8,"readers_count":7,"score":1.6,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1626177,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/9","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1886673,"username":"Raph.tba","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/50afbb/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T12:28:33.437Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi,\u003cbr\u003e\nI’m currently looking into the limitations of bulk imports in Shopify.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIn your case, with around 6,000 variants, is the main issue the cost of third-party apps, or the fact that you need to repeat this kind of update regularly?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf it’s recurring, I’d be interested to know how often you need to update those metafields.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":10,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T12:28:33.437Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":1.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1640408,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/10","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":1886686,"username":"itspaulnicoleson","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/community.shopify.com/itspaulnicoleson/{size}/411017_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-11T12:43:00.796Z","cooked":"\u003caside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Suvaydan\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"607347\" data-full=\"true\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"title\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"quote-controls\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cimg alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/s/b9bd4f/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"\u003e Suvaydan:\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cblockquote\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHello,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur Shopify store has approximately 6,000 product variants. We decided to use metafields to add individual descriptions for each variant. However, when we tried to bulk import this metafield data, we discovered that Shopify’s native CSV import does not support variant metafields.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTo accomplish this, we are required to either purchase a third-party application or build a custom solution using the Admin API. Third-party applications mean additional costs and potential security concerns.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt is quite surprising to us that Shopify grants this capability to third-party apps while not offering it through its own native import tool. This inconsistency is something we genuinely struggle to understand.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWe would like to formally request that variant metafields be supported in the standard CSV import/export functionality. This is a critical need, especially for stores with large product catalogs.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThank you.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eKemal B.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/blockquote\u003e\n\u003c/aside\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve dealt with large catalogs where variant-level data needs to be maintained separately, and I can definitely understand the frustration here. Once you’re dealing with thousands of variants, manually updating metafields or relying on a workaround becomes a serious maintenance burden.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI think supporting variant metafields in Shopify’s native CSV import/export would be a very worthwhile improvement. Even a simple column mapping system for metafield namespaces and keys would make bulk updates much safer and easier, especially when hundreds or thousands of variants need changes at once.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":11,"post_type":1,"posts_count":10,"updated_at":"2026-09-11T12:43:00.796Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":1,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":6.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":607347,"topic_slug":"feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":1631933,"hidden":false,"trust_level":2,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":true,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/feature-request-native-csv-import-support-for-variant-metafields/607347/11","category_expert_approved_group":null,"needs_category_expert_approval":null,"can_manage_category_expert_posts":false,"event":null,"reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null}],"stream":[1772523,1772533,1772545,1772628,1772990,1773076,1807002,1808240,1886673,1886686]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,207],[4,206],[7